Configure GPIO pins for the following requirements:
{{gpio_requirements}}

Provide configuration in JSON format:
{
  "pins": {
    "led_pins": [pin_numbers],
    "button_pins": [pin_numbers],
    "sensor_pins": [pin_numbers],
    "pwm_pins": [pin_numbers]
  },
  "initial_states": {
    "pin_number": "HIGH"|"LOW"
  },
  "warnings": ["any safety warnings"]
}
